│                                                                                                               │
│  ### 🏛️ **Afternoon**: **Royal Palace of Madrid** (2:00 PM – 5:00 PM)                                          │
│  - **Why?** Baroque opulence with the *Hall of Realms* and *Cabinet of Charles III*. Avoid peak hours by      │
│  arriving early.                                                                                              │
