│  - **Lunch**: *La Vía Macarena* (€45 for 2) – Michelin-starred tapas in the Centro district.                  │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ### 🎭 **Afternoon**: **Madrid International Book Fair** (1:00 PM – 4:00 PM)                                 │
│  - **Why?** Free admission to literary events, book signings, and workshops.                                  │
│  - **Dinner**: *Lavapiés Neighborhood** – Explore street art and try *empanadas* at *La Casita de los         │
│  Empanados*.                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ### 🌃 **Evening**: **Winter Light Festival** (7:00 PM – 10:00 PM)                                           │
│  - **Why?** Light installations in Retiro Park and Plaza de Cibeles. Perfect for evening strolls.             │
│  - **Dinner**: *Cervecería El Puerto* (€25 for 2) – A cozy spot for *tortilla española* and *cañas* (beer).   │
│                                                                                                               │
